 "remarks": "Enjoy living in this beautifully renovated end-unit townhouse in the heart of New Canaan. This sun-filled home has it all with wide-plank white oak flooring, stunning eat-in kitchen with quartz countertops, Thermador appliances, dry bar and a custom pantry and laundry room. The spacious living room has a gas fireplace, dining area and opens seamlessly to a private fully fenced patio- perfect for a morning coffee, outdoor dining or relaxed entertaining. The upper level offers two large en-suite bedrooms with walk-in closets. The finished expansive lower level with a half bath provides exceptional living space for a family room, private office, fitness area or media room. All major mechanical systems were newly installed in 2023 including Bosch central air conditioning, a Weil-McLain boiler and a Bradford White hot water heater. Located steps to the train station, dining, boutique shopping, cafes and the vibrant downtown that New Canaan has to offer. This turn-key townhouse with three reserved parking spaces and a attached garage is not to be missed. A must see!",
